    "body": "The #268 close-out's single remaining experiment: teacher-force the same held-out articles (raw text, 128-token context, same positions) through the same checkpoint via HF transformers or candle, outside the r4 observation/eval pipeline entirely, and measure bits/token. ~4-6 ⇒ the remaining floor is pipeline-internal (tokenization/stream reconstruction — next hunt); ~11 ⇒ the floor is the model's true quality on this stream and stands as measured. One run decides. Quoting rule until then: 11.17 bits/token (per #268 close-out).",
